    "detailed_description": "This tiny game provides a short retro arcade experience.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2>In each short game that lasts a few minutes, the player picks a character, each with their unique character ability, the goal is to destroy the enemies and become the last one standing!<br><br>The player is able to place bombs to destroy obstacles and damage their enemies, pick up power-ups to enhance their character and items to hinder their enemies.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Control</h2>Move - WASD (Keyboard) &amp; Left Joystick (Xbox Controller)<br>Place Bomb - J (Keyboard) &amp; X (Xbox Controller)<br>Push Bomb - K (Keyboard) &amp; A (Xbox Controller)<br>Character Ability - L (Keyboard) &amp; B (Xbox Controller)<br>Use Items - U, I, O (Keyboard) &amp; LB, Y, RB (Xbox Controller)<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Multiplayer</h2>Plug in one Keyboard and one Xbox Controller or two Xbox Controllers to enjoy a local two-player game\uff01",
